diff --git a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
index 04c264c9b..9acd07c01 100644
--- a/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
+++ b/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs/README_Main_Changes_Guide.md
@@ -334,7 +334,7 @@ Note: New panels added or modified mostly not mentioned here for concision. See
 - Did a similar rework of the **Info Screen** in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py); in particular in **Top 5 Cities** we now use a multilist to display more wonders in a prettier way, and in the **Wonders** tab we now **show the Wonders' Buttons** (i.e. icons) in the first column (**click to move to city** mechanic is moved to the City column instead); the **Statistics** tab now also shows buttons (plus **change default ordering** from alphabetical to **from most to least Built/Current** (avoids tedious manual user ordering each time)), and the **Graph** Tab and possibly other tabs also show buttons (e.g., **leader icons before text**, **emojis**). Also added other information (e.g., turn numbers in the Graph tab).
 - Additionally, added in the **Info Screen** a new **History Tab**, showing a **text-colored spoiler-free** account of the key moments that happened each turn. Based on the **ReplayScreen**'s text, so **preserves information on save reload** unlike the Event Log. Optional **LOG button** allows to export to `PythonDbg.log` text file the output, and has optional **caching** for performance. Change in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py). See [README.md: History Tab](/README.md#history-tab-in-the-info-screen-advisor).
 - Added in the **Info Screen** a new **Score Tab** showing a **sortable (default ordered by highest score) table** with all relevant scoreboard fields, plus **new fields** like Player ID (to distinguish identical Name/Civ/Leader/Player Color), Player color, total Power (of a player, distinct from power ratios), total Power per City, Land%, V/M. Added a clickable **"Legend"** text that **redirects to Sevopedia Concepts' "Score Tab Columns" page**. Note that unlike military ratios, PowT and PoT/C are shown even for the human player, since these vary every turn. If table has more than max rows, table expands and Legend link moves to top right. Change in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py). See [README.md: Score Tab](/README.md#score-tab-in-the-info-screen-advisor).
-- Beautified the **Victory Screen** in [CvVictoryScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvVictoryScreen.py): **added Buttons/Icons** (Leaders, Religions, Apostolic Palace, UN, Spaceship parts, Traits as chars, etc.), **Thousands Separators**, **Victory Culture Percentages** (mirroring the changes in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py)).
+- Beautified the **Victory Screen**: **added Buttons/Icons** (Leaders, Religions, Apostolic Palace, UN, Spaceship parts, Traits as chars, etc.), **Thousands Separators**, **Victory Culture Percentages** (mirroring the changes in [CvInfoScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvInfoScreen.py)). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5523+) **Always show** the **Resolutions** and **Members** tab so now all tabs are shown **even if they are empty**, and add a **fallback table** showing **required wonders** (as of now Apostolic Palace or United Nations) to make these tabs active. Change in [CvVictoryScreen.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvVictoryScreen.py).
 - Added **"Willing to become vassal"** and **"Vassal"** **icons** in the Foreign Advisor's Glance tab in the human player's row, to help avoid the need to tediously check these up through other screens, in [CvExoticForeignAdvisor.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvExoticForeignAdvisor.py), and in [CvDLLWidgetData.cpp](/CvGameCoreDLL/CvDLLWidgetData.cpp) for the corresponding **tooltip** (on hover). See ["Willing to become a vassal" and "vassal" icons](/README.md#willing-to-become-a-vassal-and-vassal-icons-in-foreign-advisors-glance-tab).
 - Beautified the **Diplomacy Screen**'s **trading rows** with **icons** (e.g., Gold, Gold Per Turn, World Map, Open Borders, Vassal, Defensive Pact; and **leader icons** (make peace / declare war / embargo)). Change in `CvPlayer::getItemTradeString`. See [README.md: Diplomacy Screen](/README.md#diplomacy-screen).
 - **Main Interface (Common)**: Moved **minimap to the right-edge** for quicker read. Add **details** to most **progress bars**; e.g. in the Tech bar `Fusion: 2245 / 5774 (35)`. Show **chars in the GP bar even if 100%** (e.g. `Great Scientist: Lyons (3) - [RESEARCH_CHAR] 100%`) Change in [GPUtil.py](/Assets/Python/BUG/GPUtil.py) and [CvMainInterface.py](/Assets/Python/Screens/CvMainInterface.py). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5514+) **Swap top left** (e.g., Treasury) **and top right** (e.g., Turn and Year) **text position**, and optionally **move commerce sliders to the right side** (allows to freely expand advisors so they use the entire left side, and is visually closer to scoreboard and most mouse controls) **in city screen or map view**. Show **Era text default ON** (as of now on top left). See [Main interface rework](/README.md#main-interface-rework).

